(text "AON 3.3V: BLE only; Wi-Fi runs on CM4. GPIO2/8/9 boot straps retain pullups.\nUART1 GPIO4 TX and GPIO5 RX connect to RP2040; UART0 GPIO20 RX and GPIO21 TX connect to CM4.\nExternal 2.4GHz antenna must sit in plastic away from the key plate, battery and cables." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 29cba0e3-dbf9-4b22-a7ef-6ab457fafa18))
